ir competency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yx5x5zuLhW8Q7kNvwG6uojF&_nc_oc=AdoYt49Jq40PkOA2T-JBjavlafJDPREnXuIlziZ7Bu5xJx1pVL2XrfE54dWrMiwReIM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEq9OzBEXVxX-CrFCu9L7M7hTIoxWmVWAvQGIOxM0uegA&oe=6A8EEAB9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f62aFoHYg78Q7kNvwFacH4u&_nc_oc=AdroRbqsP4S3vGgKsM1ctI5m8MZlgHlovlIeFb6xRsf4ihArUypwOuJbAZbvoz1HBTc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE0SgtjtpITjmIemYHwbYKM2PTs1Bzg2F0WeI6H_Vn3hw&oe=6A8ED90F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WBA7msztfgoQ7kNvwFyIf0h&_nc_oc=AdrxtvArwlp65qtMd6_Ntcl3dhNPBs8ngLFrCwtfOFqRfhxhDTqWndJelqr4--hIKgY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH6kjsRnbiZQmQ8WXLSsvgHIOWzaS0nzbHPoBWxF6-iwQ&oe=6A8EE6EE"}, {"file_name": "00